OminX
=====

OminX is a Debian 13 (Trixie) amd64 live desktop with Cinnamon, an installer,
core desktop apps, a Debian/Flatpak software center, Steam/Proton support,
Wine/Lutris, compressed zram memory, and per-game Feral GameMode.

The OminX shell theme provides a familiar bottom taskbar, centered O Start
button, pinned and grouped apps, searchable menu, system tray, and common
desktop icons. It uses original OminX styling and artwork with Linux components.

Start with the OminX Welcome application. Compatibility and performance notes
are in compatibility.md and performance.md. Full build instructions are in the
project README at:
https://github.com/ma19031435-eng/OminX-Linux

The base system and bundled applications retain their upstream licenses and
identities. OminX does not include Microsoft code or claim that every Windows
application is compatible. No universal 50% latency reduction is promised.
